way that is easy to consume for a human.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:04.200
Now let’s ask for something a little&nbsp;
different. This is not a hard problem at all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:11.220
but it requires a bit of mathematics. I&nbsp;
wonder what is going to happen here? Yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

